 "layout": {
  "summary": "customer and part in canonical row order (stored row j = source row j): uniform 65536-row groups, every numeric/integer column frame-of-reference coded, low-cardinality text (c_mktsegment, p_mfgr, p_brand, p_type, p_container) as sorted dictionaries with U8 codes, other text as offsets + bytes; key flags: stored rows sorted by c_custkey / p_partkey (kind 1), so key lookups binary-search or probe the dense position.",
  "units": "Integers exact: bigint as integers, numeric(15,2) as coefficients of scale 2 (value = coefficient / 100), dates as days since 2000-01-01 (Val::Date); frame-of-reference value = group base (I64, or U64 for dictionary indices and row positions) + unsigned code (U8/U16/U32) of the row; text offsets are byte offsets (U64, from 0) into the U8 byte part; group starts and row positions are stored-row indices; block size 65536 rows."
 }
